  <h2><a href="/web/20110101022720/http://roblox.zendesk.com/forums">Answers</a><span class="delim">/</span><a href="/web/20110101022720/http://roblox.zendesk.com/forums/200641-everyday-answers">Everyday Answers</a></h2>

  <div class="frame">
    <div class="entry nobottom" style="padding-bottom:0;">
      <h3 class="entry-title">How do I get the holiday gifts?</h3>
      <p class="sub">Reese Dec-02</p>
      <div class="user_formatted" style="margin-top:35px;">
        <p>Each gift has a clue in the description of how to get it for free. The clue tells you what you need to do, like pay attention to twitter, connect to Facebook, make so my friends, build something in some format, etc. Each one has a way to get the gift for free.<br/><br/>How it works:<br/>1. The gifts are given for free to the players who match the puzzle in the description.<br/>2. The gifts will go on sale for others to buy. So if you didn't get the gift for free you can still buy it.<br/>3. The gifts will open and something comes out for you!</p>
<p>The ROBLOXian Gift of Yesteryore is explained in this News article...</p>
<p><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20110101022720/http://blog.roblox.com/?p=3581">http://blog.roblox.com/?p=3581</a></p>
<p>How long does it take?<br/>Each gift takes a different amount of time. Some of them will be given quickly and others more slowly. The clue may give you a hint to start building or working on something so you have enough time.<br/><br/>Will all gifts be for sale?<br/>There may be some gifts that are super rare and do not go on sale.</p>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
